<title>JAPAN: Tokyo rubber futures market closed for holiday.</title>
<headline>Tokyo rubber futures market closed for holiday.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-07-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tokyo rubber futures is closed on Monday due to a national holiday. Trading will be resumed on Tuesday.</p>
<p>On Friday, the market ended lower in all months. Prices ranged from 1.0 to 2.0 yen lower, with benchmark December ending down 1.6 yen at 112.8 yen per kg.</p>
<p>-- Tokyo Commodities Desk (+81-3-3432-7391)</p>
</text>
